# The one negation: the plugin receipt's JSON Schema stays visible; the gate's name rules
# skip the schemas in src/gbf/contracts/schemas/. It names that one tracked file, so a
# schema that you exclude yourself stays excluded, and a new schema there that is named
# like restricted material, a later version of this one included, needs a negation of
# its own.
!/src/gbf/contracts/schemas/plugin-receipt.schema.json

# Media, model weights and serialized objects. A file that must be tracked
# (e.g. a golden frame) is force-added and has to be registered in
# registries/media.toml; the gate rejects unregistered ones.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.pkl
*.pklz
*.pickle

